WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:10.226
It is Saturday, three in the afternoon. Jonas and his girlfriend Mia are sitting in a small café in the old town. The waiter comes to the table.

00:00:10.476 --> 00:00:14.326
'Good afternoon! What would you like to drink?'

00:00:14.576 --> 00:00:19.003
'I'll have a coffee with milk, please,' says Jonas.

00:00:19.253 --> 00:00:24.564
'And I'd like a tea. Do you have cake too?' asks Mia.

00:00:24.814 --> 00:00:29.574
'Yes, today we have apple cake and cheesecake.'

00:00:29.824 --> 00:00:34.620
'Then I'll have a piece of apple cake. With cream, please!'

00:00:34.870 --> 00:00:48.389
After an hour they want to pay. The coffee costs three euros, the tea two euros fifty and the cake four euros. Jonas pays for everything and gives the waiter a one-euro tip.
